{"seq":1,"slug":"ts-problem-framing","title":"时间序列问题建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/time-series-deep-learning/foundations/ts-problem-framing","wordCount":1513,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"时间序列问题建模\">时间序列问题建模</h1><p>一个团队花三个月训练了一个 Transformer 去预测仓库每日出库量，上线后发现误差比运营人员手算的还大。复盘时才发现问题出在最开始：他们要的是「未来 14 天每天的出库量」，却把模型训练成了「预测下一天，再把预测当输入滚动 14 次」。误差在 14 步里层层放大。这不是模型不行，是问题建模错了。在写任何一行模型代码之前，把下面这些维度逐一钉死，比换十个网络都管用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>时间序列预测的本质是：给定历史观测 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{y_1, y_2, \\dots, y_t\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>（可能还有协变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{x_1, \\dots, x_t\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>），估计未来若干步 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{y_{t+1}, \\dots, y_{t+H}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 的取值或分布。这里每一个符号背后都藏着一个建模决策。</p>\n<p>下图展示从一条原始序列到一个可训练样本的完整建模链路：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[原始时间序列] --&gt; B{预测目标定义}&#10;    B --&gt; C[回看窗口 L&lt;br/&gt;用多少历史]&#10;    B --&gt; D[预测视野 H&lt;br/&gt;预测多远]&#10;    B --&gt; E[单变量 or 多变量]&#10;    B --&gt; F[点预测 or 概率预测]&#10;    C --&gt; G[滑动窗口切样本]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[训练集 / 验证集 / 测试集&lt;br/&gt;按时间切分]&#10;    H --&gt; I[选损失函数]&#10;    I --&gt; J[可训练问题]\">flowchart TD\n    A[原始时间序列] --&gt; B{预测目标定义}\n    B --&gt; C[回看窗口 L&lt;br/&gt;用多少历史]\n    B --&gt; D[预测视野 H&lt;br/&gt;预测多远]\n    B --&gt; E[单变量 or 多变量]\n    B --&gt; F[点预测 or 概率预测]\n    C --&gt; G[滑动窗口切样本]\n    D --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[训练集 / 验证集 / 测试集&lt;br/&gt;按时间切分]\n    H --&gt; I[选损失函数]\n    I --&gt; J[可训练问题]</pre><p>下表把五个核心建模维度并列对比，每一行都是上线前必须有明确答案的问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>取值</th>\n<th>关键影响</th>\n<th>选错的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>预测视野 horizon</td>\n<td>单步 / 多步</td>\n<td>决定能否用滚动预测</td>\n<td>误差累积、视野不匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回看窗口 lookback</td>\n<td>短 / 长</td>\n<td>决定能捕捉的依赖长度</td>\n<td>漏掉季节性或过拟合噪声</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变量数</td>\n<td>单变量 / 多变量</td>\n<td>决定能否利用跨序列信息</td>\n<td>丢弃有用相关性或引入噪声</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出形式</td>\n<td>点 / 区间 / 分布</td>\n<td>决定损失函数与下游决策</td>\n<td>无法做风险决策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协变量</td>\n<td>无 / 已知未来 / 仅历史</td>\n<td>决定信息可用性</td>\n<td>数据泄漏或浪费信息</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"预测视野与多步策略\">预测视野与多步策略</h2><p>「预测多远」直接决定了多步预测的实现方式，而不同方式的误差行为天差地别。常见有三种策略。递归（recursive）策略只训一个单步模型，预测时把上一步的输出当作下一步的输入反复滚动——实现简单，但预测误差会沿着时间逐步累积，视野越长偏差越大，开头那个出库量的例子就栽在这里。直接（direct）策略为每个未来步单独训一个模型，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{y}_{t+h} = f_h(y_{1:t})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9028em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">:</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，各步互不传递误差，代价是要维护 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 个模型且步与步之间不连贯。多输出（multi-output / seq2seq）策略让一个模型一次性吐出整个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 长度的向量，这是现代深度模型的主流做法，既避免误差累积又保持输出连贯，本 hub 后续的 <a href=\"../architectures/rnn-lstm\">循环网络 RNN 与 LSTM</a> 与 <a href=\"../architectures/transformers-ts\">时序 Transformer</a> 默认都采用它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平稳性-自相关与季节性\">平稳性、自相关与季节性</h2><p>这三个概念贯穿整个 hub，在这里讲透一次，后面所有文档遇到都只点到为止并链接回此处。</p>\n<p>平稳性指序列的统计性质（均值、方差、自协方差）不随时间改变。严格平稳几乎不存在，实践中关心的是弱平稳。多数经典模型假设输入平稳，因此需要差分或去趋势把非平稳序列「拉平」——这正是 <a href=\"classical-baselines\">经典基线 ARIMA 与 ETS</a> 里 ARIMA 的 I（积分/差分）所做的事。检验平稳性常用 ADF（Augmented Dickey-Fuller）检验，原假设是「存在单位根即非平稳」。</p>\n<p>自相关刻画序列与自身滞后版本的相关程度。自相关函数 ACF 定义为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>Cov</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mtext>Var</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_k = \\frac{\\text{Cov}(y_t, y_{t-k})}{\\text{Var}(y_t)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Var</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Cov</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>ACF 与偏自相关函数 PACF 是判断 ARIMA 阶数的经典工具，也是判断「该回看多长」的依据。</p>\n<p>季节性是固定周期的重复模式，如日度数据的周七天、月度数据的年十二月。处理季节性的方式贯穿全 hub：统计模型用季节差分，深度模型用 <a href=\"preprocessing-features\">日历特征</a> 或让网络自行从足够长的窗口里学到周期。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据切分与防泄漏\">数据切分与防泄漏</h2><p>时间序列最致命的错误是数据泄漏：让模型在训练时接触到了它在预测时不可能拥有的未来信息。普通机器学习里随机打乱 train/test 在这里是大忌——随机切分会把未来样本放进训练集。正确做法是严格按时间切分：训练集在前、验证集居中、测试集在最后，时间上互不重叠。这套思想在 <a href=\"../applications/evaluation-backtesting\">评估与回测</a> 里会展开成滚动回测的完整方法论。</p>\n<p>协变量同样要分清三类：仅历史可得（如过去的天气实测）、未来已知（如日历、促销计划）、以及完全外生。把「未来已知」的协变量喂给模型是合法且有益的，但若误把「仅历史可得」的变量按未来值喂进去，就是泄漏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评价指标的取舍\">评价指标的取舍</h2><p>问题建模的最后一环是选对指标，因为指标定义了「好」的方向。点预测常用 MAE、RMSE、MAPE，但它们各有陷阱：MAPE 在真实值接近零时爆炸，RMSE 对离群点过度敏感。跨序列聚合时，量纲不同的序列需要用 sMAPE 或 MASE（以朴素基线为分母）这类尺度无关指标。若问题要的是区间或分布，则需要 pinball loss、CRPS 等概率指标——这些将在 <a href=\"../modern/probabilistic-forecasting\">概率预测与分位数</a> 中详述。指标的系统性讨论见 <a href=\"../applications/evaluation-backtesting\">评估与回测</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>在写模型代码前，先钉死五个维度：预测视野、回看窗口、变量数、输出形式、协变量类型。</li>\n<li>多步预测优先用多输出策略，避免递归策略的误差累积。</li>\n<li>平稳性、自相关、季节性是全 hub 的公共词汇，本篇是它们的权威定义处。</li>\n<li>严格按时间切分数据、区分三类协变量，是杜绝数据泄漏的底线。</li>\n<li>指标定义了优化方向；尺度无关指标（MASE/sMAPE）适合跨序列聚合，概率指标留给区间预测。</li>\n<li>问题建模做对了，后续选 <a href=\"classical-baselines\">经典基线</a> 还是 <a href=\"../architectures/\">深度架构</a> 才有意义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"时间序列问题建模","id":"时间序列问题建模"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"预测视野与多步策略","id":"预测视野与多步策略"},{"level":2,"text":"平稳性、自相关与季节性","id":"平稳性-自相关与季节性"},{"level":2,"text":"数据切分与防泄漏","id":"数据切分与防泄漏"},{"level":2,"text":"评价指标的取舍","id":"评价指标的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"经典基线 ARIMA 与 ETS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/time-series-deep-learning/foundations/classical-baselines"}}